# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. The analysis panel is derived from FanGraphs and Cot's Baseball
# Contracts and is not ours to redistribute. See data/README.md for how to
# reconstruct it. Nothing in data/ is tracked except that README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything the pipeline writes. Reproducible by definition, so keeping it
# under version control only creates diff noise and merge conflicts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/*
!output/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
*.rds
.Renviron

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artifacts, if you compile the manuscript alongside this
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
*.swp
